
# LanCache-NG (https://github.com/wiki-mod/lancache-ng)
# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# What: every text file is checked out with LF line ends
# Why: all files run inside Linux containers
* text=auto eol=lf

# What: certificate and key files are never converted
# Why: a changed byte breaks a certificate or key
*.crt binary
*.key binary
*.pem binary

# What: git writes the release tag into an archived setup.sh
# Why: a source archive has no .git; the tag is its version
# From: Issue #1683 | PR #1858
setup.sh export-subst
